          text: "Head spa combines everything that makes hygiene important: warm water, sprays and mist, close contact with skin and hair, shared tools and a lot of textiles. Clients cannot see most of your hygiene work, but they notice immediately when it is missing, and a single case of a contagious scalp infection passed between clients can do lasting harm to them and to your business. The standards in this lesson are the minimum, not the ideal.",
